ologies</p>\n<p>Capitalism: You sell one cow and buy a bull to expand your herd.</p>\n<p>Socialism: You give one cow to your neighbor to ensure equity.</p>\n<p>Communism: You give both cows to the government, which then gives you some milk.</p>\n<p>Fascism: You keep the cows but give the milk to the government, which sells it back to you.</p>\n<p>Nazism: The government shoots you and takes the cows.</p>\n<p>Bureaucratism: The government takes both cows, shoots one, milks the other, and pours the milk down the drain.</p>\n<p>New Dealism: You shoot one cow, milk the other, and pour the milk down the sink.</p>\n<p>Totalitarianism: The government takes the cows and denies they ever existed.</p>\n<p>Anarchism: Your neighbor hits you with a brick, steals the cows, and shoots them for fun</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 5, "score_up": 23, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "SAVE AMERICA", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCIhXodL", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 543, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8780677, "raw_content": "", "author": "laredditarmy", "created": 1786738704752, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "HobisterCavinboub", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCIhXodL.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/pM0WL7vYSFCs.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/lKfftHHcYFAx957G.jpeg", "width": 768, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 565}], "blurhash": "U9N^G1_48_xa